      "writtenOn": "2023-11-09T16:00:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Prior to https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/759558 (and afterwards), `VkSamplerYcbcrConversionCreateInfo`\u0027s `pNext` is always unconditionally getting explicitly assigned as `nullptr` and is only re-assigned in this case (building for Android, `info.fExternalFormat`). \n\nI don\u0027t think it would hurt anything to double check, but I also don\u0027t think we need it - what could we be overwriting?",
